                <note rend="inline" type="source">740.0011 Pacific War/856</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">President Roosevelt
                        to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >The White House, Washington</hi></placeName> [<date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1941-12-06">December 6,
                        1941</date>].</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Dear Cordell</hi>: Shoot this<anchor n="69"
                        xml:id="d417-f1"/> to Grew—I think it can go in gray code—saves time—I don’t
                    mind if it gets picked up.</p>
                <closer><signed>F.D.R.</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
